,"Water Available","Water Connected","Water Source: Public","Security Features: Fire Sprinkler System, Gated Community, Security Gate, Smoke Detector(s)"],"tags":["central_air","central_heat","community_clubhouse","community_golf","community_outdoor_space","community_park","community_security_features","community_spa_or_hot_tub","community_tennis_court","dining_room","dishwasher","recreation_facilities","tennis_court","washer_dryer","community_swimming_pool","single_story","basketball_court","rental_property","efficient","basketball","volleyball","playground","tennis","den","game_room","exercise_room","clubhouse","shopping"],"description":"FABULOUS FULLY FURNISHED CONDO WITH FLEXIBLE OPTIONS AS AVAILABLE AND NEW EXTERIOR PAINT ON BUILDING! Long(er) term rentals may be an option when free yet MOSTLY used for Short Term Rentals by the week/month(as available) for vacation or corporate guests; monthly/weekly prices VARY by season and may be negotiable(PLUS applicable state and local taxes may apply which are the same taxes as hotels)! NO PETS OR SMOKERS IN UNIT! Welcome to this wonderfully renovated and fully furnished 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom condo, located on the second floor of the prestigious Windsor Palms Resort. Just 3 miles from Walt Disney World, this condo offers an ideal combination of comfort, convenience, and modern updates, making it perfect for vacationers, professionals, or those in transition. This unit has been thoughtfully updated for both comfort and efficiency. A newer Carrier central heat and AC system with a Nest thermostat (installed in late 2017) and a newer hot water heater (2017) provide peace of mind and comfort. The condo is tastefully decorated with flat-panel TVs, ceiling fans, and a king-size bed in the main bedroom. It comfortably sleeps six, making it a great choice for family vacations. A full-size washer and dryer are included, and daily valet trash service adds a touch of resort-style convenience. As a resident or guest, you'll have free access to Windsor Palms' extensive community amenities. These include a large communal pool with a tiki bar, a whirlpool spa, a clubhouse with a fitness room, a game room, a movie theater, and courts for tennis, basketball, and volleyball. A playground is also available for the younger guests. For your convenience, the resort also has an on-site sundry shop. Its central location provides easy access to Orlando's world-class attractions, dining, and shopping. The flexible rental options, from a week to a few months, make this condo a versatile and appealing choice. Please note that this unit is a non-smoking property and does not allow pets, ensuring a clean and comfortable environment for all. Equal opportunity housing.","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1991,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m2643334596r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["yard","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m2643334596s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m2643334596r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m3292384287r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["condo","yard","exterior"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m3292384287s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m3292384287r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m4214937828r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["condo","road","yard","exterior"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m4214937828s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/375f74854a39d83383d2dfe00f113f27l-m4214937828r.